  "2026-10-12T10:47:28.391Z",codex-sol,"Companion epic: pm-cli-website-ox5m. Package-owned implementation and receipts remain in this tracker. No remote writes or releases are authorized."
  "2026-10-12T11:01:19.881Z",codex-sol,"Verified SDK gap in the installed version: PmClient.schemaAddField(name, { type }) drops the type, storing every field as string. Public client.run(schema, { name, options: { subcommand: add-field, fieldType } }) preserves number and boolean types. The package uses that public action and tests numeric PR matching and boolean resolved state with real temp trackers. No upstream issue was filed."
  "2026-10-12T11:20:38.827Z",codex-sol,"Read-only manual CLI acceptance against public unbraind/pm-rl#68 at head 14669bcf58229e7226eed958470babc06c88d570: packed extension installed into a scratch pm project; import created 50 items, updated 0. Round exited 1 as expected: checks pending; CodeRabbit finished true; unresolved threads 0; unvoted bot comments 0; pending imported items 14; unimported nodes 0. Precedents returned 0 before a scratch-only refusal and 1 afterward. Verdict reported applied/replied/reacted/resolved false. No apply or remote mutation ran against the public PR."
  "2026-10-12T11:23:52.481Z",codex-sol,"Coverage passed across all 16 authored executable source/tooling modules: statements 100 percent, branches 100 percent, functions 100 percent, lines 100 percent; 69 tests passed, zero failures/skips/TODOs. The coverage launcher now isolates its raw-data directory explicitly so nested gate tests cannot erase the outer report. Behavioral revert proofs follow in the command feature receipts; every reverted function was restored byte-for-byte before final gates."
  "2026-10-12T11:26:56.321Z",codex-sol,"PM-linked runner acceptance passed node --test test/core.test.ts: 11 tests passed, zero failures or skipped tests, using the host schema sandbox. The sandbox did not override the explicit scratch tracker roots. Default PM test result tracking is disabled, so this comment records the result without changing project test-tracking or telemetry settings."
  "2026-10-12T11:37:32.205Z",codex-sol,"Release gates passed for the unchanged implementation: npm run release:check 11/11 stages, bun run release:check 11/11 stages, and isolated HOME with GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null plus GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 npm run release:check 11/11 stages. Each passed 69/69 unit/behavioral tests and 1/1 packed acceptance test covering npm/npx and native Bun/bunx; zero failures/skips/TODOs. Coverage: statements/lines 1586/1586, functions 83/83, branches 526/526 across 16 source/tooling modules. ESLint clean; duplication zero; 46 declarations documented; production audit zero; tarball 37 files confined to dist, README, LICENSE, CHANGELOG, manifest and package.json. Five behavioral revert proofs failed as expected. Isolated strict health passed. No remote writes, repositories, PRs, releases or real apply actions were performed."
  "2026-10-12T12:31:47.685Z",codex-sol,"Final source commit 5fe85ac passed npm run release:check, bun run release:check and isolated HOME with GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null plus GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 npm run release:check: 11/11 stages each. Each run passed 69/69 behavioral/tooling tests and 1/1 packed acceptance test covering independent npm/npx and native Bun/bunx consumers; zero failures, cancellations, skipped tests or TODOs. Coverage across 16 authored executable source/tooling modules is statements 1588/1588, lines 1588/1588, functions 83/83 and branches 529/529, all 100 percent at unchanged thresholds. ESLint clean; duplication zero; 46 declarations documented; production audit zero; tarball 37 files restricted to dist, README, LICENSE, CHANGELOG, manifest and package.json; changelog and publish attestation passed without publishing. Isolated strict health passed. Eight behavioral disable proofs failed as intended and restored implementations passed; the corrected marker proof supersedes its earlier failed baseline receipt. Final source replay of the 84-request public fixture still yields 50 findings: 14 pending and 36 informational. The earlier real read-only manual acceptance receipt remains valid. Work is local only; no remote creation, push, PR, release, publish or real apply action occurred."
  "2026-10-21T19:36:10.989Z",codex-agent,"Authorized tracker reconciliation, audit 2026-10-21. Owner-authorized takeover of any historical assignment for this verified terminal transition. Reverified current main 68eea9cccf2a: merged #1 (fcf34e5); source tree exactly matches the audited snapshot. **Durable bot review context and exact-head round gates.** [PR #1](https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/pull/1) (fcf34e5), src/ and real SDK fixtures deliver durable ReviewFinding context, verdict/reply/reconcile and exact-head round commands; later #9/#12/#16 extend the shipped source."
  "2026-10-21T19:41:37.012Z",codex-agent,"Tracker-only reconciliation applied to the authorized audit candidates. Linked git diff --check passed. After this final pm write, regenerate with npm run changelog:full; npm run changelog:check and npx pm health are the remaining local gates. Full release gates are delegated to CI; no implementation functions changed, so behavioral revert proof does not apply."
  "2026-10-22T12:09:57.276Z",codex-agent,"PR #26 review plan: pulled remote eba5719 and merged current main 260d41c before corrections. Verified README Development and evidence requires items to remain open for orchestrator verification. Main has this epic in_progress without terminal timestamps; the only PR changes are this epic and its append-only history. Thread PRRT_kwDOVGABD86vDZ8L is valid. Latest CodeRabbit review has no Outside diff range findings. Retain historical audit receipts, reopen this epic and run tracker-only gates; no implementation revert proof applies."
  "2026-10-22T12:10:52.704Z",codex-agent,"Tracker evidence proof for PRRT_kwDOVGABD86vDZ8L: 7/7 categories passed against main 260d41c: active status, no current terminal metadata, matching main lifecycle, README policy, unchanged main history prefix, unchanged pre-fix eba5719 history prefix, and tracker-only diff. The reopen command archived prior closure evidence rather than editing historical entries. npm ci passed (164 packages, zero vulnerabilities); initial health passed 10/10 checks with zero warnings and no merge receipt reconciliation needed. Self-review found no other changed item or implementation defect. The tracker-only evidence exception applies; no behavioral source revert is applicable. Keep this epic in_progress for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-22T12:12:44.940Z",codex-agent,"PR #26 final gate receipt: npm ci passed; npm run changelog:full regenerated successfully; pm test pm-review-epic --run --only-last --progress --timeout 600 passed 1/1 (npm run changelog:check, exit 0); identity check reported zero violations; git diff --check passed. Normal-home health exposed the existing global pm-github version mismatch (pinned host 2026.10.19 versus global extension 2026.10.22), while isolated-home strict health passed all 10 checks with ok=true. Initial health with extensions disabled passed 10/10 with zero warnings; the full isolated check is the package health receipt. No timeout occurred. Claim released; epic remains in_progress. No new pm CLI/SDK defect established; the global extension environment mismatch is outside this tracker-only correction."
  "2026-10-23T15:22:54.612Z",codex-agent,"STALE-CLAIM: audited main e1fc83a81507ca6a91f1675b74863c050f1a89f1; no open PR or recently pushed live branch references this record. Inspected: README.md, .agents/pm/epics/pm-review-epic.toon. Remaining: PR 26 deliberately restored this epic pending orchestrator/maintainer verification; its expected_result retains that owner decision. Source delivery alone is insufficient. Release contention and leave approval/verification open. Release historical contention and retain real work as open; no delivery/cancellation is claimed."
